WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.544 --> 00:00:01.657
- What's that?
(audience cheering)

00:00:01.657 --> 00:00:03.962
Should I say hold on?

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:05.323
My producer is trying to get my attention.

00:00:05.323 --> 00:00:06.387
Is that for sure?

00:00:06.387 --> 00:00:07.552
Really? This is crazy!

00:00:07.552 --> 00:00:08.986
Right now?

00:00:08.986 --> 00:00:09.993
That's insane!

00:00:09.993 --> 00:00:12.928
Ladies and gentlemen, this is amazing.

00:00:12.928 --> 00:00:14.899
Of course, you're all
familiar with Aquaman, right?

00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:16.204
Okay?
(audience cheering)

00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:17.775
Yeah.

00:00:17.775 --> 00:00:19.679
I've just been told, listen up,

00:00:19.679 --> 00:00:23.136
I've just been told that
Aquaman is about to spawn

00:00:23.136 --> 00:00:25.531
right here on stage.
(audience laughing)

00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:26.499
This is insane!

00:00:26.499 --> 00:00:28.855
It's, yeah, it's mating season,

00:00:28.855 --> 00:00:32.515
and he's decided to do it right there!

00:00:32.515 --> 00:00:33.604
Okay, hold on!

00:00:33.604 --> 00:00:34.884
There he is!

00:00:34.884 --> 00:00:36.604
There's Aquaman.

00:00:36.604 --> 00:00:39.347
King of the seven seas,
monarch of the oceans.

00:00:39.347 --> 00:00:40.484
He's swimming around,

00:00:40.484 --> 00:00:42.787
making sure the area is safe for his mate!

00:00:42.787 --> 00:00:44.092
This is fascinating.

00:00:44.092 --> 00:00:46.175
And here comes Aquawoman.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.838
Aquawoman!
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.838 --> 00:00:51.088
Here she comes!

00:00:52.601 --> 00:00:55.159
She is clearly swollen with eggs!

00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:57.418
- [Andy] Oh, laden. My goodness.

00:00:57.418 --> 00:01:00.091
- After a brief courtship ritual

00:01:00.091 --> 00:01:01.463
where they just sort of look at each other

00:01:01.463 --> 00:01:03.541
and have a courtship ritual,

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:07.257
she releases her eggs onto the sea floor

00:01:07.257 --> 00:01:09.532
while Aquaman stands guard!

00:01:09.532 --> 00:01:10.449
There she goes!

00:01:10.449 --> 00:01:13.235
(audience cheering)

00:01:13.235 --> 00:01:14.860
The eggs have been released,

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:17.092
and now it's Aquaman's turn.

00:01:17.092 --> 00:01:19.012
He hovers over the eggs!

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:22.402
(audience groaning)

00:01:22.402 --> 00:01:24.997
I said, "He hovers over the eggs!"

00:01:24.997 --> 00:01:26.627
(audience laughing)

00:01:26.627 --> 00:01:29.848
And carefully deposits his aqua-sperm,

00:01:29.848 --> 00:01:30.681
or milt...

00:01:32.637 --> 00:01:34.512
Over the eggs!

00:01:34.512 --> 00:01:35.771
There you have it!

00:01:35.771 --> 00:01:38.571
(audience cheering)

00:01:38.571 --> 00:01:39.404
Aquaman

00:01:40.325 --> 00:01:44.581
(chuckling) has successfully spawned!

00:01:44.581 --> 00:01:45.998
Oh, so beautiful!

